<title>POLAND: Poland to increase heating price from July 1.</title>
<headline>Poland to increase heating price from July 1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish household heating prices will increase five percent from July 1 as envisaged in the 1997 national budget, the finance ministry said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The price of state-distributed hot water will rise to 25.5 zlotys a month per tenant from the current 23 zlotys.</p>
<p>Under the budget, this will be the last heating price increase in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
